{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-22387","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22382","text":"Dual- and Triple-Loop Machine Architecture"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-22389","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22383","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE update (OS-010, 2026-04):"},{"id":"spn-22384","text":" With the introduction of OS-010 PULSE, the loop-interlock pattern documented here is now formalized as a manifest standard. Graphonomous, PRISM, AgenTroMatic, and every other portfolio loop declare their phases in "},{"id":"spn-22385","marks":["code"],"text":"<loop>.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-22386","text":" files (see "},{"id":"spn-22387","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/manifests/"},{"id":"spn-22388","text":"), validated against "},{"id":"spn-22389","marks":["code"],"text":"pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-22390","text":". The \"dual loop\" is a special case of arbitrarily nestable PULSE loops — the same machine grouping works at any depth, and PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-22391","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-22392","text":" phase reads the inner system's PULSE manifest to discover the "},{"id":"spn-22393","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-22394","text":" boundary at runtime rather than hard-coding the integration. See \"Triple loop and beyond\" below."}]}],"id":"blk-22388","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-22390","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22395","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-22391","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22396","text":"PRISM and Graphonomous are both closed-loop systems. When PRISM evaluates Graphonomous, their loops interlock — the outer loop (PRISM) improves the benchmark while the inner loop (Graphonomous) improves the memory. Each makes the other sharper."}]},{"id":"blk-22392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22397","text":"The machine architecture solves the tool explosion problem: 47 PRISM tools + 29 Graphonomous tools = 76 tools in a shared session. Research shows tool selection accuracy degrades to ~49% at that scale, and schema overhead burns 40-80K tokens."}]},{"id":"blk-22393","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22398","marks":["bold"],"text":"Solution:"},{"id":"spn-22399","text":" Group tools by loop phase, not category. 6 PRISM machines + 5 Graphonomous machines = 11 tools. Selection accuracy jumps to ~95%."}]},{"id":"blk-22394","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22400","text":"The Interlocking Loops"}]},{"id":"blk-22395","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Graphonomous (memory loop)          PRISM (evaluation loop)\n──────────────────────────          ───────────────────────\nretrieve  \"What do I know?\"         compose    \"What should I test?\"\nroute     \"What should I do?\"       interact   \"Run the test\"\nact       \"Do it\"                   observe    \"Judge the result\"\nlearn     \"Did it work?\"            reflect    \"What should change?\"\nconsolidate \"Clean up\"              diagnose   \"What's actionable?\""},{"id":"blk-22396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22401","text":"When PRISM benchmarks Graphonomous:"}]},{"id":"blk-22397","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"PRISM compose ──→ PRISM interact ──→ PRISM observe ──→ PRISM reflect ──→ PRISM diagnose\n                       │\n                       ▼\n              ┌─── Graphonomous ───┐\n              │  retrieve → route  │\n              │  → act → learn     │\n              │  → consolidate     │\n              └────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-22398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22402","text":"PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-22403","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-22404","text":" phase drives the system-under-test through its own closed loop. PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-22405","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-22406","text":" phase judges how well that inner loop performed. PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-22407","marks":["code"],"text":"reflect"},{"id":"spn-22408","text":" phase evolves scenarios based on where the inner loop failed."}]},{"id":"blk-22399","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22409","text":"PRISM: 47 tools → 6 machines"}]},{"id":"blk-22400","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22410","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-22411","text":" — \"What should I test?\" (9 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-22401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22412","marks":["code"],"text":"scenarios"},{"id":"spn-22413","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22414","marks":["code"],"text":"validate"},{"id":"spn-22415","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22416","marks":["code"],"text":"list"},{"id":"spn-22417","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22418","marks":["code"],"text":"get"},{"id":"spn-22419","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22420","marks":["code"],"text":"retire"},{"id":"spn-22421","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22422","marks":["code"],"text":"import"},{"id":"spn-22423","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22424","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_register"},{"id":"spn-22425","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22426","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_discover"},{"id":"spn-22427","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22428","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_generate"}]},{"id":"blk-22402","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22429","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-22430","text":" — \"Run the test\" (8 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-22403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22431","marks":["code"],"text":"run"},{"id":"spn-22432","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22433","marks":["code"],"text":"run_sequence"},{"id":"spn-22434","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22435","marks":["code"],"text":"run_matrix"},{"id":"spn-22436","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22437","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-22438","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22439","marks":["code"],"text":"transcript"},{"id":"spn-22440","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22441","marks":["code"],"text":"cancel"},{"id":"spn-22442","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22443","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_evaluate"},{"id":"spn-22444","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22445","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_compare"}]},{"id":"blk-22404","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22446","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-22447","text":" — \"Judge the result\" (5 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-22405","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22448","marks":["code"],"text":"judge_transcript"},{"id":"spn-22449","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22450","marks":["code"],"text":"judge_dimension"},{"id":"spn-22451","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22452","marks":["code"],"text":"meta_judge"},{"id":"spn-22453","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22454","marks":["code"],"text":"meta_judge_batch"},{"id":"spn-22455","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22456","marks":["code"],"text":"override"}]},{"id":"blk-22406","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22457","marks":["code"],"text":"reflect"},{"id":"spn-22458","text":" — \"What should change?\" (7 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-22407","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22459","marks":["code"],"text":"analyze_gaps"},{"id":"spn-22460","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22461","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve"},{"id":"spn-22462","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22463","marks":["code"],"text":"advance_cycle"},{"id":"spn-22464","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22465","marks":["code"],"text":"calibrate_irt"},{"id":"spn-22466","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22467","marks":["code"],"text":"cycle_history"},{"id":"spn-22468","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22469","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_recommend"},{"id":"spn-22470","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22471","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_infer_profile"}]},{"id":"blk-22408","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22472","marks":["code"],"text":"diagnose"},{"id":"spn-22473","text":" — \"What's actionable?\" (13 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-22409","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22474","marks":["code"],"text":"report"},{"id":"spn-22475","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22476","marks":["code"],"text":"failure_patterns"},{"id":"spn-22477","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22478","marks":["code"],"text":"retest"},{"id":"spn-22479","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22480","marks":["code"],"text":"verify"},{"id":"spn-22481","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22482","marks":["code"],"text":"regressions"},{"id":"spn-22483","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22484","marks":["code"],"text":"suggest_fixes"},{"id":"spn-22485","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22486","marks":["code"],"text":"leaderboard"},{"id":"spn-22487","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22488","marks":["code"],"text":"leaderboard_history"},{"id":"spn-22489","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22490","marks":["code"],"text":"compare_systems"},{"id":"spn-22491","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22492","marks":["code"],"text":"dimension_leaders"},{"id":"spn-22493","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22494","marks":["code"],"text":"fit_recommendation"},{"id":"spn-22495","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22496","marks":["code"],"text":"compare_fit"},{"id":"spn-22497","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22498","marks":["code"],"text":"task_profiles"}]},{"id":"blk-22410","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22499","marks":["code"],"text":"config"},{"id":"spn-22500","text":" — Admin/setup (5 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-22411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22501","marks":["code"],"text":"set_weights"},{"id":"spn-22502","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22503","marks":["code"],"text":"register_system"},{"id":"spn-22504","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22505","marks":["code"],"text":"list_systems"},{"id":"spn-22506","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22507","marks":["code"],"text":"get_config"},{"id":"spn-22508","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22509","marks":["code"],"text":"create_profile"}]},{"id":"blk-22412","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22510","text":"Graphonomous: 29 tools → 5 machines"}]},{"id":"blk-22413","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-22511","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-22512","text":" — \"What do I know?\" (6 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-22414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-22513","marks":["code"],"text":"context"},{"id":"spn-22514","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22515","marks":["code"],"text":"episodic"},{"id":"spn-22516","text":", "},{"id":"spn-22517","marks":["code"],"text":"procedural"},{"id":"spn-22518","